.TH parsec-cli 1  "parsec-cli 3.9.4-a.0+dev" 
.SH NAME
parsec\-cli \- Parsec cli
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBparsec\-cli\fR [\fB\-\-progress\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Parsec cli
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-progress\fR \fI<PROGRESS>\fR [default: spinner]
How message are displayed
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
quiet
.IP \(bu 2
plain
.IP \(bu 2
spinner
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: plain]
How to format outputted data
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
plain
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR [default: auto]

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
parsec\-cli\-server(1)
Contains subcommands related to server operations
.TP
parsec\-cli\-device(1)
Contains subcommands related to devices
.TP
parsec\-cli\-invite(1)
Contains subcommands related to invitation
.TP
parsec\-cli\-organization(1)
Contains subcommands related to organization
.TP
parsec\-cli\-user(1)
Contains subcommands related to user
.TP
parsec\-cli\-workspace(1)
Contains subcommands related to workspace
.TP
parsec\-cli\-certificate(1)
Contains subcommands related to certificate
.TP
parsec\-cli\-ls(1)
List workspace contents
.TP
parsec\-cli\-rm(1)
Remove a file from a workspace
.TP
parsec\-cli\-tos(1)
Contains subcommands related to Term of Service (TOS)
.TP
parsec\-cli\-shared\-recovery(1)
Contains subcommands related to shared recovery devices (shamir)
.TP
parsec\-cli\-man\-page(1)
Print CLI man pages to the console or a file
.TP
parsec\-cli\-sequester(1)
Contains subcommands related to sequester operations
.TP
parsec\-cli\-auto\-complete(1)
Display autocomplete setup script for shell
.TP
parsec\-cli\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v3.9.4\-a.0+dev
